1
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,500
Pots fall silent in the sink.

2
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:28,760
I stop my work and start to think.

3
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,000
That warm and sultry Spanish song.

4
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,500
I loved and missed it for so long.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
I sit right down beside your chair.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
My voice joins in with yours right there.

7
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:55,500
I raise your wrist to help you play.

8
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:01,439
Just like I taught you day by day.

9
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,819
Why play a rumba, slow and sweet?

10
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:12,450
This is a strange and swaying beat.

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:17,640
You speak of lessons and the floor.

12
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:23,099
I see you are shy no more.

13
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:28,290
Your blushing face begins to glow.

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,849
You talk about a girl you know.

15
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:38,829
You say her name is Ginger now.

16
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:44,530
She broke your shell, I wonder how.

17
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Who is this girl who holds your hand?

18
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:55,439
Who brings this rhythm to our land?

19
00:01:56,500 --> 00:02:00,650
A mother's heart beats fast inside.

20
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,629
With sudden curiosity and pride.

21
00:02:29,379 --> 00:02:31,180
Who is she Paul?

22
00:02:32,340 --> 00:02:34,139
Who is she?

23
00:02:36,990 --> 00:02:38,789
Who is Ginger?

24
00:02:42,770 --> 00:02:49,560
Ginger who?